  "content": "<a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/bisect\"><img width=100% src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702795/bisect.png\"></a>\n<img width=100% src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ObscuriaLithium/obscurialithium.github.io/refs/heads/main/assets/images/obscure-tooltips-logo.jpg\">\n\n<center>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Fabric\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Forge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"NeoForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Neo Forge-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/899742852681191444?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=&labelColor=231C25&color=5c2a21\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/obscure-tooltips-media-kit-VPpfjxP\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"媒体工具包\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/获取媒体工具包-5c4521?style=for-the-badge&logo=imgur&labelColor=251C20&logoColor=white\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n### <center>Obscure Tooltips 是一款完全客户端的视觉增强模组，能将普通的物品提示框转变为生动、富有动感的展示面板。它通过引入流畅的动画、动态粒子效果以及随物品稀有度和上下文变化的装饰性边框，为你的物品栏增添沉浸式的视觉魅力。</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769699368/header/features.png></center>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769703577/obscure-tooltips-showcase-1.gif\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>动画提示框</h1>\n            <p>流畅的动画、发光的边框以及细腻的粒子效果，让每一个提示框都栩栩如生。多种样式支持丰富的视觉装饰——从动画饰物到分层效果——让每件物品都独具特色且富有表现力。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>集成模型</h1>\n            <p>在提示框内直接查看任何护甲、工具或武器的完整3D模型。无需装备或打开额外菜单，即可快速预览装备。</p>\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769703746/obscure-tooltips-showcase-2.jpg\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769703975/obscure-tooltips-showcase-3.gif\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>平滑滚动</h1>\n            <p>当提示框高度超出屏幕时自动启用平滑滚动，保持文本清晰可读，避免杂乱。让你自然浏览长篇描述，无需调整UI大小。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>自动换行</h1>\n            <p>智能换行功能让宽提示框保持整洁、清晰且格式完美。长名称、背景故事和属性数据排列整齐，不会超出布局范围。</p>\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769703747/obscure-tooltips-showcase-4.jpg\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4yIqabL.gif\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>无与伦比的定制性</h1>\n            <p>Obscure Tooltips 是首个引入全动画、视觉丰富提示框的模组，此后虽出现类似模组，但其模块化、数据驱动的设计依然提供了一种独特而灵活的方式，使你能够<a href=\"https://obscurialithium.github.io/obscure-tooltips/#tooltip-styles\">构建</a>和<a href=\"https://obscurialithium.github.io/obscure-tooltips/#style-merging-fallback\">合并样式</a>、<a href=\"https://obscurialithium.github.io/obscure-tooltips/#tooltip-filters\">创建条件</a>，并<a href=\"https://obscurialithium.github.io/obscure-tooltips/#core-concept\">自定义每个元素</a>，以符合你的设想。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2zmjwZJ.png\"></center>\n\n<br>\n\n## 游戏内配置\n在 Minecraft 1.20.1 中，当使用 [Forge Config Screens](https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-screens) 或 [Configured](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured) 模组时，即可获得游戏内配置菜单。若未安装这些模组，所有设置仍可通过配置文件调整（*config/obscuria/obscure_tooltips-client.toml*）。从 Minecraft 1.21.1 开始，游戏内配置界面将直接可用，无需额外依赖。\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769699408/header/more-from-obscuria.png></center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aquamirae\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/aquamirae.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/obscure-tooltips\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/obscure-tooltips.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/pillager-caravans\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/pillager-caravans.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ars-elixirum\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/ars-elixirum.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/accents\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/quXJZzx.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/blank.png\" width=\"45%\" />\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Obscuria\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/patreon.png\" width=\"90%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/discord.png\" width=\"90%\" /></a>\n</center>",
